+//!   and a metadata table follow the market. The rollback drops the investing fields
+//!   (refusing while any Bits are invested, so nobody's stake is forgotten) and sets the
+//!   bytes after the market aside under `V3TAIL`, where a later upgrade to v3 finds them.
